    <item>
      <title>Pie Charts</title>
      <link>/docs/statistics/pie-charts/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/docs/statistics/pie-charts/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Some stats are shown for all pings and for desktop only pings.&#xA;The desktop pings show a significantly different profile, possibly because many automated ZAP scans run in the cloud&#xA;and many cloud providers are located in the USA.&#xA;We also know that quite a few companies run ZAP as a SaaS offering which will also skew the stats.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
